{
  "hadith_number": 9,
  "text": "9th Hadith, on the authority of Abu Hureira, Abd-Arahman, Ibn Sakhir, may Allah be pleased with him. He said, I heard the messenger of Allah, made a blessings and peace of Allah be upon him, say, what I have forbidden to you, avoid, what I have ordered you to do, do as much as you can. It was only their excessive questioning and their disagreeing with their prophets, that destroyed those who were before you. It was related by Abu Hureira and Muslim.",
